      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fair enough, I removed it. If I feel like we still want it I may add a followup change using a parameter in the JGit config to configure the timeout.\n\nI don\u0027t think configuring the maximum number of suggested reviewers accomplishes what I want. At Google we\u0027re seeing backend RPCs get arbitrarily blocked by network delay for 800ms. The parallelization is intended to allow other requests to make progress even while 1 is blocked, which doesn\u0027t work if we have fewer parallel requests.",
